  "body": "## Change and scope\n\nFreestanding `#840`-style priced obstruction under [#1898](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1898) at `(b,a,x)=(38,2,2)`. Names a **fourth** dirt-legal readout alphabet at `Q=8` beyond same-walk / dirty-shadow / partitioned dual / one-repeat / two-repeat: **shared-dirt** (joint even live-read parity) dual on distinct partitioned walks. Soft-overlap-safe vs deferred shared-XOR (R-side dirt coupling only).\n\n| Dual schedule | Covering pairs | Exact min R | Tariff floor (X\u22650) | Undercuts 436? | Beats independent floors? |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---|---|\n| Independent `(2,6)` (#2851) | 3916416 | **92** | \u2265488 | no | \u2014 |\n| Shared-dirt `(2,6)` (this) | 3916416 | **82** | **\u2265468** | **no** | **yes** |\n| Independent `(3,5)` (#2851) | 10416000 | **98** | \u2265500 | no | \u2014 |\n| Shared-dirt `(3,5)` (this) | 10416000 | **82** | **\u2265468** | **no** | **yes** |\n| Independent `(4,4)` (#2851) | 14165760 | **100** | \u2265504 | no | \u2014 |\n| Shared-dirt `(4,4)` (this) | 14165760 | **82** | **\u2265468** | **no** | **yes** |\n\nGlobal shared-dirt min is `R=82` (spectra include 82/88/96). Abstract tariff `38\u00b78+2\u00b782=468>436`. Undercuts independent-dirt floors but not the six-query endpoint.\n\n**Scoped obstruction / priced alphabet; no new kappa.** Leave-alone through [#2861](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2861) / [#2860](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2860) / [#2858](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2858) / [#2851](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2851) was not reopened.\n\n## Result\n\nPackage: `research/shared-dirt-walks-8q/`.\nTip: `fc3a2cb3362934b1e34df974e64f9d0acfe07b77`.\n\nExact: partition min R **82** (tariff floor **468**); no undercut of 436.\n\n## Validation\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -I -B research/shared-dirt-walks-8q/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -O -B research/shared-dirt-walks-8q/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/shared-dirt-walks-8q/independent.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/shared-dirt-walks-8q/test_package.py\npython3.12 -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/shared-dirt-walks-8q\n```\n\nExpected:\n\n```text\nPASS_SHARED_DIRT_WALKS_8Q_OBSTRUCTION partition_min_R=82 ... tariff_floor=468 ... soft_overlap_shared_xor_safe no_new_kappa\nPASS_SHARED_DIRT_WALKS_8Q covering_26=3916416 ... partition_min_R=82 tariff_floor=468 ... no_new_kappa\nPASS_SHARED_DIRT_WALKS_8Q_PACKAGE_TESTS groups=6\nPASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE research/shared-dirt-walks-8q outcome=completed\n```\n\nDefault verify is read-only. Admission uses `need()`; `-O` also passes.\n\n## Overlap and credit\n\nClosest prior: [#2851](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2851), [#2861](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2861), [#2860](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2860), [#2858](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2858), [#2677](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2677). Freestanding shared-dirt alphabet; deferred shared-XOR not reopened; no competing open PR at refresh.\n\nCredit the mutable-source / #2851 / #2861 / #2860 / #2858 / PR1898 lineage. Prepared by Wentao Li ([VictorLiwentao](https://github.com/VictorLiwentao), [@Is__Victor](https://x.com/Is__Victor)) with substantial AI assistance, under Apache-2.0.",
